{"id":"7dbb9ea84aee2b45","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-definable.md","title":"可定义的对象族","display":"df-definable — 可定义的对象族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-definable","aliases":["16-df-definable","Definable fibre object"],"display":"df-definable — 可定义的对象族","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]"],"source":"Definition 9.6.1, p. 569 (PDF 589)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-definable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-definable</span><span>Definable fibre object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definable — 可定义的对象族"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 9.6.1, p. 569 (PDF 589)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>；笛卡尔箭头见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Definable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Definable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubstClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubstClosed}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,X))\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\land X\\in P\\Rightarrow Y\\in P\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,X))\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\land X\\in P\\Rightarrow Y\\in P\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Definable}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists X&#39;\\in P)(\\exists i_X:X&#39;\\to X)\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(i_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall Y\\in P)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow(\\exists!h:Y\\to X&#39;)\\ i_Xh=f\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Definable}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists X&#39;\\in P)(\\exists i_X:X&#39;\\to X)\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(i_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall Y\\in P)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow(\\exists!h:Y\\to X&#39;)\\ i_Xh=f\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>可定义的是替换稳定的对象集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，其泛近似 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X&#39;\\to X\">\\(X&#39;\\to X\\)</span> 限制那些满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的索引。</li>\n<li>“由泛对象分类”是另一个概念，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a>；它不能替代本书 §9.6 的 definability。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 9.6.1, p. 569 (PDF 589)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$；笛卡尔箭头见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"“由泛对象分类”是另一个概念，见 [[16-df-generic-object]]；它不能替代本书 §9.6 的 definability。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Definable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubstClosed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,X))\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\land X\\in P\\Rightarrow Y\\in P\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Definable}_p(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists X'\\in P)(\\exists i_X:X'\\to X)\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(i_X)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall Y\\in P)(\\forall f:Y\\to X)\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow(\\exists!h:Y\\to X')\\ i_Xh=f\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"X'\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c48874733bb3770","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\mathrm{SubstClosed}_p(P)$，见 [[16-df-definable]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-definable|df-definable — 可定义的对象族]]"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","427be4d627513590","f600e95377e8cbf9"]}